 to get dice with which to disable threats or unlock abilities. Roll. Die. Repeat.","steam_appid":3842190,"support_info":{"email":"hello@aonorte.com","url":"https://aonorte.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}